# WS2-05. # Sources: spec/04-expressions.md §3 (temporaries, including inside nested calls and aggregate literals, live until the end of the statement and drop there in reverse creation order; only the chosen ?: arm and the needed && / || operand evaluate) and spec/03 §5.
Two argument temporaries drop in reverse creation order.
profiles: host
with: tok.clo
expect: output
contrast: sum2(tok(1), tok(2)) ==> sum2(tok(1), tok(5))
contrast-expect: output
--- output
drop 2
drop 1
3
end
--- contrast-output
drop 5
drop 1
6
end
